<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia AMDB year net up 36.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia AMDB year net up 36.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, '97</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  45.80   vs	  33.48</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  7.8    vs	   5.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   796.34   vs	 565.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    68.63   vs	  60.53</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  7.48   vs  less   0.23</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries     add  3.31   vs  less   1.39</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Arab-Malaysian Development Bhd is involved in property development, manufacturing, hotel operation and road construction.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
